  "description": "SMARTIES is a spectrum-aware multi-sensor auto-encoder foundation model for remote sensing images. It projects data from heterogeneous sensors into a shared spectrum-aware space, enabling sensor-agnostic representations and generalization to unseen sensors. It uses a unified transformer backbone with spectrum-aware projection layers, cross-sensor token mixup, and masked image modeling for self-supervised pretraining.",
